# Forms
- flag @urgent
- scalar @due:2026-10-01
- list @person:[bob, priya]
- empty list @tags:[]
- empty items are dropped @x:[a, , b,]
- spaces inside items @client:[Acme Corp]
- escapes @x:[a\, b, c\]d] @y:a\ b @z:\[not-a-list
- bar in a list outside a table @x:[a|b]
- a colon with no value is text @key: then
- unclosed list @key:[a, b is text
- trailing punctuation @due:2026-10-01.
- flags before punctuation are text @urgent, @later.
- mixed case is one key @helloWorld
- keys are case-sensitive @Due:2026-10-01 @due:2026-10-02
- a flag must end at whitespace @key.name
- a flag at the end of the line @last

# Recognition
bob@example.com is text
@Bob is a key; @1x and @-x and @_x are text
(@paren is text
@start of a line
\@escaped is text
`@code` and $@math$ and [[@link]] hold no tokens
@a:b@c is one scalar
@a:`b` takes the backticks
